  "evidence": [
    "137 checks:13 controlled domain admission cases,54 actual API/regression cases and70 generated OpenAPI contract cases. Full worker127 includes126 active/one existing opt-in retention skip. Both gates use the same8299 unchanged source inputs with format/architecture.",
    "Eight native-only operations expose currently eligible space discovery, bounded cross-company contacts, canonical identity selection, device registration/status/retry and exact-target freeze/drain. Current account/native/group/client/MFA remains mandatory; metadata grants neither HR access nor provider credentials.",
    "Actual ordinary employee fixtures use independent accounts and native sessions. Cross-company contact labels are visible while the other company HR list is forbidden; revocation/offboarding and foreign spaces withhold previously observed metadata.",
    "Missing native credentials, browser transport, outdated/invalid client headers, malformed IDs, missing operation IDs/observed versions and invalid device origins cannot mutate. Default-disabled group deployment rejects all eight routes.",
    "Selection, registration and freeze replay preserve the original public receipt without new provider work. Safe queue status excludes lease owner/token/native queued proof. Actual retained freeze/drain reports the exact target and leaves the original ACTIVE until the separately admitted worker completes.",
    "The generated OpenAPI parser/controller-coverage and existing contract suite pass. Group routes require nativeBearer and explicit client headers, distinguish chat eligibility from HR company access, bound contact search/page size and mark required request fields. Distinct primitive schemas prevent chat search bounds changing unrelated operations.",
    "Initial137-case run failed seven cases: a real shared-schema mutation plus new test assumptions about array iteration, shared admin identity/permission/count state, public receipt shape and an incomplete HR list query. Second run had two failures: missing OpenAPI required annotations and one wrong expected freeze error code. Corrections preserve native admission/use-case/controller behavior; exact changed inputs are retained above."
